DATABASE_PASSWORD=#The password for the database connection. This should be kept secret and not shared publicly. Set at creation of the database.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=#The public key for Supabase. This key is safe to expose in client-side code. Find in API Keys.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=#The secret key for Supabase. This key should be kept secret and not shared publicly. Find in API Keys.
NEXT_PUBLIC_NODE_ENV=#The environment in which the application is running. This can be 'development', 'production', or 'test'.
SUPABASE_DATABASE_URL=#The URL for the Supabase database connection. This should be kept secret and not shared publicly. Find in Data API